  66:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  interrupt on the two DMA Streams. The output stream should have higher
  67:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  priority than the input stream.
